{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：20:00 2026-10-04 HKT</p>\n\n<p>處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》雖然已經播畢，但劇中演員近況仍受到關注，近日飾演「小吉」一角的章景恆（Tristan），近來人生大事。章景恆昨日（3日）與拍拖多年的圈外女友Coco拉埋天窗，二人的婚禮場面溫馨又感人。</p>\n<h2>章景恆太太金器份量十足</h2>\n<p>章景恆的新婚妻結束婚宴後，於今日（4日）凌晨在IG分享婚禮的照片，一對新人於早上按傳統穿中式裙褂出門，見到章景恆太太到達婚宴會場時，仍戴住份量十足的龍鳳鐲及金豬牌。從照片所見，章景恆的新婚妻雙臂戴滿至少5對厚重的龍鳳金鐲，頸上更掛著大金豬牌，金光閃閃貴氣逼人。</p>\n<img alt=\"章景恆去年在小鎮向女友求婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0436ab6a9af7ba9f1bb4228af7ac36d7/2026-10/Tristan_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆去年公開求婚成功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/561e6ba94c962121d8ca72f3c6b36393/2026-10/Tristan_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆日前曝光結婚照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5b7ef3ae876310b09ea85d74e9acd50/2026-10/Tristan_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆已成為人夫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af2cf4f154d4216330157929018f8922/2026-10/Tristan_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆的太太一早在酒店準備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5feee06338b2d311bf290e8cad130b4f/2026-10/tristan_35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆的新婚妻穿上中式裙褂出門。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2a2534be7e8bd758c93cd7d625747d5/2026-10/tristan_48.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆與太太靠在古董車前拍攝婚照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c0ca25569fd9be880f97388e698d138/2026-10/tristan_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆與太太在婚宴開始前舉行註冊儀式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b906c9fe64f125784d3ccec2a2764c98/2026-10/tristan_15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆與太太簽字。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/227316c01041845407f5253e6319cfff/2026-10/tristan_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆拖住太太進場時，已激動到爆喊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b854965a531a2fd3602fa89b3c210e54/2026-10/tristan_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆眼淚如決堤一樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e61e4f7863f193f7305e18453d40132/2026-10/tristan_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆與太太好感動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7776792f9389d7e812594f532e6d991e/2026-10/tristan_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆太太安慰老公。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a518c26e42ea7ca51b29130c0386f8d/2026-10/tristan_17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆獲太太拭淚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51e2fc4cb064b6182092edef85168089/2026-10/tristan_21.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆喊住進行儀式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42bf8cc20a82c99677f7aacf0c880f36/2026-10/tristan_38.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆夫婦換上另一套晚裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb4c0f425adc3d2fe8f15858a80f1fe5/2026-10/tristan_44.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆與太太咀足30秒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b702ac807b47c630f44bfe9ef50a3975/2026-10/tristan_46.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆與太太放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/801c3c4e9a9e3a58f7bcd100761d6bf4/2026-10/tristan_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆夫婦敬酒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cfe28926eb651660839d24c192c70c7f/2026-10/tristan_24.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆的太太戴住好多金器。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d1f53aa75a184f1185015df99b8b6ea/2026-10/tristan_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"金豬頸鍊好重手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4facd22d965bdf85e40138015f8437af/2026-10/tristan_95.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆太太手上目測有10隻龍鳳鈪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd9bae0d5f464480bf875e6e60f090b9/2026-10/tristan_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆太太晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16268fbc1acedcc5b3df3a4bbaaf84b7/2026-10/tristan_52.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"戴夢夢到賀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1cc770479376a8f0a2cf14d046d8f216/2026-10/tristan_73.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《愛．回家之開心速遞》拉隊賀章景恆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ace0740dd4f486cafb2475a271dcc1e/2026-10/cheung_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭世豪出席章景恆婚宴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0dc92a8c959b9dab2a67c94894760d28/2026-10/tristan_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"見到張振朗擔任章景恆兄弟團。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d8148e0e0ef11ff2b11d0442203e1f2/2026-10/tristan_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆的第25期藝員訓練班合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66ea922799b580f825e75cc3ebe8a3f3/2026-10/cheung_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆與藝訓班同學關係要好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fb03f8956fcc85d5996aa444adc60f5/2026-10/cheung_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆的回禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b43ad3b56b95dd3b4a5898a0a4d00dee/2026-10/tristan_47.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"婚宴會場佈置。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70afcbed0e9535dcc345bd64e5701582/2026-10/tristan_49.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"婚宴現場擺滿一對新人靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/727fcf82a59e809d0ab1392ded05d65f/2026-10/tristan_51.jpg\"/>\n<h2>章景恆獲群星到賀</h2>\n<p>章景恆的婚宴現場擺放多張一對新人的甜蜜婚紗照，又見到有代表二人愛情的「LOVE」字樣裝飾。在一眾親友的見證下，章景恆與太太在婚宴現場進行註冊儀式，之後一對新人進場時，章景恆已難掩激動之情，數度感動落淚，而太太亦表現感動，又為老公用紙巾拭淚，場面感人。</p>\n<p>一對新人在台上進行儀式，並在賓客起哄下上演「30秒世紀之吻」，將全晚氣氛推向高峰。新娘子Coco全晚換上多套婚紗、晚裝，當中包括傳統中式裙褂、簡潔的白色婚紗，以及高貴的藍色晚裝，每一套都明艷照人。章景恆入行15年，見到鄭世豪、湯盈盈、鄧永健、穎嵐、譚坤倫、嘉駿、羅浩銘、戴夢夢等到賀，其中第25期藝員訓練班的同學張明偉、胡中慧、蔡慧欣、阮政峰等也有出席，而張振朗更擔任兄弟團。</p>\n<h2>章景恆時肥時瘦關健康事</h2>\n<p>34歲的章景恆於2011年報讀TVB藝員訓練班，入行後演出不少投閒置散的角色，近年在《愛．回家之開心速遞》中飾演茶飲店職員「小吉」，與「熊尚善」滕麗名有對手戲。不過入行初期青靚白淨的章景恆，一度突然暴肥，加上留鬍鬚打扮變成大叔，章景恆曾解釋體重一直維持在68至70公斤，因為健康問題導致「時肥時瘦」，上鏡時才覺得特別明顯。</p>\n<img alt=\"章景恆的IG有不少型仔相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3549006c89dfbc93ebf16983492bf51b/2026-10/Tristan_66_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆是2011年報讀TVB藝員訓練班學員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7ba8bd1d462aa4eba9c75087fdf5659/2026-10/Tristan_67_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆已入行15年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/533680937fee56b21a951e316fc41b3d/2026-10/Tristan_69_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆已演出數十部作品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94b123522b82ad068ae26f8a4ffa4b64/2026-10/Tristan_68_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆纖瘦時期。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69ab113f11954e4f2c549fdc52ce79df/2026-10/Tristan_61_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆曾演出《黯夜守護者》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2b2a89828533c99bef0d2df7bed9a0e/2026-10/Tristan_71_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《愛．回家之開心速遞》初代「小吉」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ecea6524b0f4274c6f02a85a5d77e897/2026-10/Tristan_60_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆曾演出《愛．回家之開心速遞》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/52fa74e35de4129a38e709b632f46b76/2026-10/Tristan_63_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆與「熊尚善」滕麗名有對手戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7eeceb052cdaa1f4fbb14e88043ba55b/2026-10/Tristan_61_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆開始發脹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/068acf5f2814a90eeb7ad5cb44d6cbd5/2026-10/Tristan_62_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆發福後散發出大叔味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9571e72e3fe6ff14243f428a16c0a94f/2026-10/Tristan_64_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆肥胖加上留鬚，即走晒樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/86e65cdbcb0081f4795ecd063c354b4d/2026-10/Tristan_72_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆入行已15年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/419b25494ddd6052704708ca52b5fade/2026-10/Tristan_65_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆曾透露因健康問題，導致時肥時瘦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b1f125ee2cd66de2059d32c29519c91/2026-10/Tristan_64_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆入行多年飾演閒角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2847e6239d68d934bd9058772ac857a9/2026-10/Tristan_63_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆演出《反黑英雄》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8c33b3bfaae9e45dc2d3c17b208c2f8/2026-10/Tristan_61_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆與蔡景行在《反黑英雄》飾演袁偉豪手下。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44687d0d47a19de0474164518eca4b5a/2026-10/Tristan_62_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"章景恆演出《反黑英雄》遭袁偉豪殺害。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ceb31d0462daf51881943e9a51757e0/2026-10/Tristan_60_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T12:18:12.245995+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":773,"images":50,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}